<title>Data and Formulas</title>

<subsection xml:id="subsec-Learning-Goals">
  <title>Learning Goals</title>
<p>
<ul>
<li><em>Compare two sample means numerically and graphically.</em></li>
<li><em>Carry out a simulation-based analysis to investigate the difference between two population means.</em></li>
<li><em>Carry out a theory-based analysis to investigate the difference between two population means.</em></li>
</ul>
</p>  
</subsection>

